WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:01.840
This is the Directory:

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:05.160
every Vegan place, person and group we know,

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.500
city by city.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.700
Local Food is where to eat in your chapter.

00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:12.500
Products are the brands you can buy anywhere.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.779
Services are the people who can help, from coaches to doctors.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.320
Media is the shows, films and books the community loves.

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:27.120
And Community and People are the groups, nonprofits and voices of the movement.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.980
We want to hear from you.

00:00:29.940 --> 00:00:32.640
As a member, you shape where this Directory goes:

00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:35.540
submit a listing, tell us who we should be featuring,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:38.660
let us know if you see something that needs to be fixed,

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:40.520
and vote for your favorites every day.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.520
That is how places rise.

00:00:43.180 --> 00:00:44.540
Membership is free.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:48.400
Pick your city, and go see what is near you.

